posure.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"expected visits were calculated using anomaly detection algorithms applied to the preceding 30 days of ED visits, excluding the most recent 2 days.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Student t -tests were used to derive p-values, and p<0.05 was considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Adaptive multiple linear regression fits a model to a baseline of 28 days\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The model adjusts for linear trends, day-of-week effects, and holidays.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"When the regression model does not fit the baseline data well based on adjusted R-squared values\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}